<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Nestle.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Nestle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 15 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Nestle SA, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls 100 shares.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2,200 CHF		 PREMIUM	18.72 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.27 CHF		  GEARING	15.43 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   23.DEC.98		 PAYDATE	10.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,960 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
